// The proving hub's day (M5 M6): one key, the look-dev day's blue hour after sunset (19:45 in
// `content/lookdev/lookdev_day.ron`, which says what each group does), held at every hour, so the hub
// looks the same whatever hour a scene asks for, and a trip into it and out again shows the zone's day
// coming and going. A `TodTimeline` document (`sapphire_world::tod`) that `proving_hub.zone.ron` names, and
// its probe grid's bake reads for its one key. The cooker reads it through the zone: no importer reads a
// bare `.ron`.
(
    type: "sapphire::world::TodTimeline",
    version: 1,
    data: (
        keys: [
            (
                // The look-dev day's blue hour after sunset, as it is there.
